    "summary": "Use it in the opposing player's [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), right after an enemy unit picks its targets. Pick 1 **AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM CHARACTER** unit of yours (not **OFFICIO ASSASSINORUM**) that is the target of at least 1 of the enemy unit's attacks.\n\nFor the rest of the phase:\n\n- Its models get a 4+ invulnerable save.\n- Once the attacker has resolved all its attacks, if your unit is outside **[Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range)** of every enemy unit, it may move up to 6\" as a **[Normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move)**, moving as if it had **FLY**.",
